entativeness":0.9307934045791626,"text_excerpt":"I ordered the steak plate, and it did not disappoint. The steak was moist and tender. I ordered my steak well-done and it was cooked perfectly - it wasn't over cooked or burned. The seafood potatoes were also creamy and addictive."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
